  "description": "Provides SkiaSharp integration for the FFmpeg .NET wrapper.\n\t\t\tEnables converting FFmpeg AVFrames to SKImage or SKBitmap, and includes high-level classes (FFCodec2Skia, SKVideo) for decoding and rendering videos or images with Skia.",
