  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "=== 2.3.0 ===\n\t\t\tAdded SKAnimatedImage - a class that allows for both automatic and manual decoding auf image/video data.\n\t\t\t=== 2.2.0 ===\n\t\t\tAVFrame.CopyTo(SKBitmap) allows now empty bitmaps.\n\t\t\tSKBitmap.Reference(AVFrame). Same as AVFrame.AsSKBitmap(), just with an existing SKBitmap.\n\t\t\t=== 2.1.0 ===\n\t\t\tAdded CopyTo-Extension that copies the content of SKBitmap/SKImage into an existing AVFrame\n\t\t\tBugFix: Removed blocking scheduler from SKVideo\n\t\t\t=== 2.0.0 ===\n\t\t\tSome smaller BugFixes\n\t\t\tAdded xml docu into the package.\n\t\t\tSome functions got renamed.",
